{"id":"9919dea7144eefd8","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-order-function.md","title":"可计算阶函数","display":"df-order-function — 可计算阶函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-order-function","aliases":["43-df-order-function"],"display":"df-order-function — 可计算阶函数","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§17.2, print pp.514–516 / PDF pp.534–536","source_locator":"§15.1.11 preceding Definition 15.1.25, printed p.424 / PDF p.444; Lemma 16.1.6, printed p.482 / PDF p.502","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-order-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-order-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-order-function — 可计算阶函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§17.2, print pp.514–516 / PDF pp.534–536"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§15.1.11 preceding Definition 15.1.25, printed p.424 / PDF p.444; Lemma 16.1.6, printed p.482 / PDF p.502"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Order}(h)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Computable}(h)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(h(n)\\le h(n+1))\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(h(n)&gt;b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Order}(h)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Computable}(h)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(h(n)\\le h(n+1))\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(h(n)&gt;b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用§15.1.11与Lemma 16.1.6的可计算、非递减且无界阶函数约定；§17.2 Definition 17.2.1单独使用的order只要求非递减，不能独自支持本节的较强接口。是否另外要求h(0)&gt;0需由各使用者明确声明，不能在零值时除以h(n)。</p>\n<p>来源：可计算无界阶函数见§15.1.11（印刷页424 / PDF页444）与Lemma 16.1.6（印刷页482 / PDF页502）；§17.2（印刷页514–516 / PDF页534–536）提供较弱的order背景。版本为用户提供的2007-07-28草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Order}(h)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Computable}(h)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(h(n)\\le h(n+1))\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(h(n)>b).","display":true}],"bytes":1389,"backlinks":[{"id":"ea9cbc7f8cc8654f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]，$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]，$\\mathrm{Computable}^A$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]；$\\mathrm{ComputableTrace}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-trace]]；$\\mathrm{Computable}^A$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"91bad7e9096c3b8f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\Phi_e^A$ 见 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]；$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]。$h$ 下式限于 $\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$J^A:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 由下式函数图定义。"},{"id":"bcb978a14a477f5c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X,A\\in2^\\omega$，$g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 总定义；$C$、$\\operatorname{Order}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-order-function]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。下式引入 $\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,A)$、$\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)$、$\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)$。"},{"id":"657049ad6accfaac","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$J^A$ 见 [[43-df-jump-traceable]]，$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]，$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-428","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-order-function]] — 可计算阶函数"},{"id":"071deac27e228ccf","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\operatorname{CE}(A)$；$\\operatorname{ArrayComputable},\\operatorname{ArrayNoncomputable}$ 见 [[43-df-array-computable]]，$\\operatorname{KummerComplex}$ 见 [[43-df-kummer-complex]]，$C$、$\\equiv_T$、$\\operatorname{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-order-function]]。集合按特征序列取初段。"},{"id":"ab85279fd837dade","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C(\\sigma\\mid n)$、$\\operatorname{Order}$、$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}$、$\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-condplainkolm]]、[[43-df-order-function]]、[[43-df-comprandom]]、[[43-df-partial-computable-random]]